<title>USA: House leader not giving up on budget negotiations.</title>
<headline>House leader not giving up on budget negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>House Republican Leader Dick Armey of Texas said on Friday he was not ready to give up on budget negotiations with the administration. But he said the next week was crucial to get a deal.</p>
<p>&quot;I think next week is probably the week we're going to find out if we really have a chance to put this together,&quot; Armey told reporters. &quot;I don't think there is any reason to give up on the process.&quot;</p>
<p>Talks between budget committee members and administration officials were continuing Friday at the Capitol.</p>
</text>
